</header>
<section id="content" role="main">

<section id="single-column-text">
<h1>EXTRACTS OFFER BREWERS CONSIDERABLE ADVANTAGES</h1>
<p>With more than 170 years of hop growing and processing experience, we understand that quality hops start in the hop yards. Hopsteiner offers a full-range of innovative hop and hop products. Our hop processing technology allows for a great degree of homogenization (regardless of the size to be produced) in order to guarantee the consistency of the end product.</p>
</section><!--/#single-column-text-->

